WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.190
Wow! It's like the ones they sell in stores!

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.490
Nene-nee didn't tell you?

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:12.410
Nope! She said to keep 
out while she's cooking!

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.810
She must really like you, then.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:15.750
Huh?

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.930
She did let you come to 
her house, didn't she?

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:26.160
Here... I know I took a direct hit here.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.880
This distance...

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:32.720
If they actually aimed for me, then 
that ARMANOX's ability must be...

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:35.930
Um?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:39.860
Nana-san said the dough should 
be about as soft as an earlobe.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.600
Feel your own earlobes, then.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.690
Why don't you come make xiaolongbao with us?

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:50.610
That aside...

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.320
Give this to your sister for me.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.700
What is it?

00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:59.500
A lucky charm.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:16.970
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:16.800
The Two Princeps

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.290
Ma'am!

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:38.670
Shingetsu...

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:40.710
How is she?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.260
Why did this happen?

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:49.250
I believe someone intended to steal 
the Fugo family's magic stone.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.150
Where is Anna?

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:58.030
Why didn't you come back?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:03.310
Everything went wrong after you left.

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:04.910
Our family, Onee-sama...

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.250
If you hadn't left without
saying anything, they—

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.250
No!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:10.980
It's not...

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.140
Shingetsu-chan's fault.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.840
Shingetsu-chan was—

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.540
Mangetsu.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:26.100
I will find Anna and send her back home.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.550
What are you going to do?

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:33.170
I have to defeat her.

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:39.200
To be honest, I always hoped that 
someone else would defeat Anna.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:43.360
Then she wouldn't have to deal with 
the humiliation of losing to me.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.370
So all this time, you intentionally...

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.790
I was naïve.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.750
But she took the Fugo family's 
magic stone, didn't she?

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.460
Even with that, she can never defeat me.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.590
Amazing...

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:09.080
Everyone says that, but...

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.600
I never put in any conscious 
effort to obtain this power.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.560
Still, people are influenced by me, admire me,

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.440
envy me, grow jealous of me, despise me...

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.340
and hate me.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.650
Mangetsu...

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.150
Watch me tonight.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.710
I will settle things with Anna on my own.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.000
Okay.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.260
Here.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:17.910
What's this?

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:21.690
A good luck charm to help you win.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.470
It's... all right.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:36.570
Yeah.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.830
You're going to fight Shingetsu?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:45.690
How did you...

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:50.450
It's a full moon, so I thought I'd 
find you somewhere around here.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:52.070
I see.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.200
Mom told me before

00:05:55.200 --> 00:06:01.340
that only one who is loved by Magiaconatus 
can become the one and only mage.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.790
Are you loved by Magiaconatus?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.630
Clare...

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:11.840
Onee-sama...

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.420
I want the three of us 
to play together again.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:20.390
With you and Shingetsu and 
me, I know we'd have fun!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:25.620
We used to say how there was so 
much we wanted to do together...

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:36.030
I'm not quite sure why things 
turned out this way, either.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:42.120
Fun times, things I wanted 
to do, dreams for my future...

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:47.020
I had so many of them, but 
now, none of them matter.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:53.550
Sometimes, I don't even care 
about GRANBELM or being a mage.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:54.780
Then—

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.000
But still...

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.560
I want to hurt Ernesta.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.160
I want to see her squirm, suffer,

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:07.770
be racked by torturous thoughts, 
and writhe in a bog of despair.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:12.640
Only in that moment will I feel happy.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:16.450
Only the sight of her suffering can calm me

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:19.750
and give me a sense of happiness.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.160
Onee-sama...

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.900
I'm sorry.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:33.160
It's already been a long, long time...

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:37.160
since my spirit shattered.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.690
What is this place?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:52.480
Magiaconatus must have 
deemed it the most suitable

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.170
for tonight's battle.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:04.760
It's as if magical power is 
wrapping itself around me!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.000
Now I can...

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.470
Ernesta!

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:16.760
I'll say it one more time.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.470
You cannot defeat me.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:26.190
Don't make me laugh!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.370
Shingetsu-chan...

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.270
The moon...

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:52.710
She's different now...

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.170
That's right!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.050
I am the...

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.560
exact opposite of what I was!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.390
This is an important battle!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.990
Please don't interfere!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.950
Who cast that curse?!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:27.000
You still don't know?

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.290
Answer me...

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.500
now!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.650
<i>Do you think this is only double the usual?</i>

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.850
<i>There's at least three...</i>

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:53.900
<i>no, a hundred times more magical 
power coming to me than before!</i>

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.150
<i>You cannot easily—</i>

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:58.820
Wha—

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.740
<i>You don't get it?</i>

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:09.240
Using that much magical power

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:11.590
creates an equivalent backlash.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.630
Ernes—

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.720
This time... I'm serious!

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:45.330
No matter how large your magic stone is...

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.040
No matter how great your power is...

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.500
How well it works depends on the user.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.380
If you can't master it, then...

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:11.690
Ernesta!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.400
This is it! This is it!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.910
This is where it <i>truly</i> begins!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:26.920
This is...

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.660
Now, Ernesta...

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.840
It's time for you to writhe 
in a bog of despair!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:39.290
By the power of my ACONITE RENATA!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.510
Wow...

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:12.820
<i>She's using magic to control gravity.</i>

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.580
Huh? Nene-chan?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.080
<i>I'm right here.</i>

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.840
You were a pig all along?!

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.420
It's a communicator!

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:22.810
<i>But why?!</i>

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:25.390
Well, you know... I just have to see

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:28.230
who wins this battle.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.920
The best way to block an enemy attack

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.240
is to use the unique 
qualities of your own magic

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.550
to erect a barrier that 
applies an opposing force

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:54.920
to the unique qualities 
of your enemy's magic!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.270
<i>For instance, darkness versus light,</i>

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.710
or freezing cold versus intense heat.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.130
The magic of the Carmine Witch

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.970
is founded upon the power 
to control temperature!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.220
Which means...

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.640
<i>It can unleash two attacks</i>

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.600
of opposing magical attributes!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.110
Not good enough!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.200
Embers!

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:46.050
What a fantastic feeling!

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:53.770
There's still plenty more 
where that came from!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.010
This is the power of the 
Fugo family's magic stone.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.230
If it can gather unlimited magical power...

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:25.460
You forced me to use a spirit.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.470
You can take pride in that.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:36.780
Screw you!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:48.400
Growth!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:07.340
Growth!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:18.970
How dare you?!

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:24.240
Die!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.910
Ernesta...

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.490
Using a spirit demands 
sufficient magical power

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:41.330
and a greater amount of time 
to reconstruct your spell.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:42.780
Indeed.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:48.340
I know! I can tell!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:53.100
<i>You look calm, but you're 
terrified, aren't you?</i>

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.870
<i>You're absolutely terrified, aren't you?!</i>

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.180
Would you like to find out?

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.700
Are you provoking me?

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:06.440
Me, the one with a burning 
heart and a cool head,

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.940
the Carmine Witch?!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:11.950
I'll show you what lies below Hell!

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.540
<i>I can't think about defending.</i>

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:20.160
<i>I have to believe!</i>

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:39.320
Ernesta!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.900
Slowly...

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.780
Slowly, now...

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:56.660
Just like a cat tormenting a little bird!

00:16:57.590 --> 00:17:01.470
<i>The spirit is still alive? No... a double?</i>

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:03.670
<i>She had time to construct 
such an immense spell?</i>

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.120
After the energy it took to unleash 
that spirit... When did she...

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.770
I didn't construct the spell.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:40.480
The air has been heated and cooled 
rapidly in a short amount of time,

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:41.910
which created layers.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.190
A mirage...

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.480
I only manipulated the layers of air a bit

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.670
so that they would project 
the image of that spirit.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:54.810
And I suppose you think this means I've lost?

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:59.940
You've fought more than enough,

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:05.580
under the weight of the Fugo name, 
to become the one and only mage.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:10.970
Please, put a stop to this 
and forgive yourself.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:16.260
<i>Clare, your mother, and everyone 
else... They all love you.</i>

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:20.550
<i>Unlike me, you have people who love you.</i>

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.790
<i>Accept them!</i>

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:28.440
<i>I promise that you'll never see me again.</i>

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:36.420
<i>You shouldn't be disappointed 
by the world that you see.</i>

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:43.070
Anna... You don't belong here.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.200
You shouldn't be bound by mages and magic.

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.890
Take a step forward into a world of beauty.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.490
<i>Look forward.</i>

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.200
Ernesta...

00:18:59.030 --> 00:18:59.740
<i>Yes?</i>

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.370
It's so strange.

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:16.550
To think that magical power 
could make all this possible...

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.210
That you're capable of doing all this...

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:32.940
Anna...

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:43.370
That is why...

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.750
That is why...

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:04.630
I can't win unless I do this!

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.560
Yes! Yes!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.680
Yes!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.440
Adrenaline!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.860
Dopamine!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:22.240
Endor...

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:26.500
phin!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:37.590
VIOLA KATZE's magic signature 
is critically low!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.590
She's in trouble!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:39.670
Shingetsu-chan!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.300
I thought we weren't supposed to interfere?

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:48.390
<i>Why...</i>

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.640
<i>Why do you love me?</i>

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:55.160
I hate it so much...

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:57.370
I don't need power.

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:59.750
I wish I didn't have any magic.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:05.570
I truly do... So why do you...

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:09.240
Oh, yes...

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.360
This is what I wanted to see, Ernesta.

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:16.460
From the moment you were acknowledged,

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:22.550
from the moment I realized you had more 
power than me, that has been my only goal.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.630
My reason for living!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:27.400
Ernesta...

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:31.600
I am truly happy right now.

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:49.600
Ah... My heart feels so light.

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.890
How long has it been since I felt so happy?

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:58.390
I've waited so long for this moment...

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:00.540
For this moment alone...

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.800
For this ecstasy.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.140
Anna...

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:11.320
I will never forget this 
moment for as long as I live!

00:22:56.830 --> 00:22:58.350
No... No!

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:03.160
No! No!

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:08.160
No!

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:29.130
Anna, searching any longer 
won't help. You won't find it.

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:33.720
That's enough... Please, that's enough...

00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:37.100
I found it!

00:23:38.460 --> 00:23:41.010
The magic stone handed down 
through the Ernesta family.

00:23:41.430 --> 00:23:43.230
It's small, but it's yours.

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:45.610
Anna...

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:52.220
Now, maybe you can become a mage, too!

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:02.790
<i>Awaiting Mangetsu and the others is 
a reality they struggle to accept.</i>

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:07.440
<i>However, this is another trial they 
must overcome to become mages.</i>

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:11.130
<i>Intersecting intentions and teeming malice</i>

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:13.400
<i>eat away at the young girl's heart,</i>

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:16.240
<i>creating ambiguity through the 
warped decision she reaches.</i>

00:24:16.770 --> 00:24:18.600
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.770
<i>"What It Means to Become a Mage."</i>

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:21.430
<b>What It Means to Become a Mage</b>

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:24.790
<i>Magical power boils life over a low flame...</i>

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.030
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
